<title>BELGIUM: EU to send 216 tonnes sugar aid to Uganda.</title>
<headline>EU to send 216 tonnes sugar aid to Uganda.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union will send 216 tonnes of sugar as food aid to Uganda, the EU Official Journal said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The contract was awarded to Mutual Aid, based in Antwerp, Belgium, at a price of 330.99 Ecus a tonne.</p>
<p>The sugar aid will be distributed via the 24-member non-governmental organisation Euronaid.</p>
<p>--Brussels Bureau +322 287 6830</p>
</text>
